{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":726500102,"next_line_ids":[726500103,726500104],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":4203649570,"text":"看你的样子应该是外国的旅行者吧。如何，对「心流」，有兴趣吗？","raw_text":"看你的样子应该是外国的旅行者吧。如何，对「心流」，有兴趣吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
