{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":726500106,"next_line_ids":[726500107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":401189658,"text":"总之，这是老身独创的技术。与岩藏流、喜多院流，还有外国的「西风剑术」这些用武器战斗的流派不同，我的技术的精髓在于磨练「心流」，再利用「心流」磨练战斗技巧的流派。","raw_text":"总之，这是老身独创的技术。与岩藏流、喜多院流，还有外国的「西风剑术」这些用武器战斗的流派不同，我的技术的精髓在于磨练「心流」，再利用「心流」磨练战斗技巧的流派。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":726500107,"next_line_ids":[726500108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":1225072538,"text":"早年流浪海外，四处钻研武道时，我曾观察过纳塔人的「拳斗术」。这种武道流派在练习时，会与假想敌战斗。","raw_text":"早年流浪海外，四处钻研武道时，我曾观察过纳塔人的「拳斗术」。这种武道流派在练习时，会与假想敌战斗。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":726500108,"next_line_ids":[726500109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":1932800674,"text":"「假想敌」？","raw_text":"「假想敌」？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":726500109,"next_line_ids":[726500110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3988305538,"text":"会打你的「幻想朋友」。","raw_text":"会打你的「幻想朋友」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":726500110,"next_line_ids":[726500111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":2670607978,"text":"没错。幻想敌人的行动，再针对幻想做出反应。这种在当地被称为「影子拳斗」的练习技巧，在老身看来是相当孤高的修行法。","raw_text":"没错。幻想敌人的行动，再针对幻想做出反应。这种在当地被称为「影子拳斗」的练习技巧，在老身看来是相当孤高的修行法。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":726500111,"next_line_ids":[726500112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":2602842634,"text":"而「心流」就是将这种修行发挥到极致的无限制格斗流派。在老身的指导下，什么样的假想敌都能得到再现。","raw_text":"而「心流」就是将这种修行发挥到极致的无限制格斗流派。在老身的指导下，什么样的假想敌都能得到再现。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":726500112,"next_line_ids":[726500113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":2386159210,"text":"从史莱姆到落武者，甚至是那些至冬国来的异人战士。只要精通心流的心得，就轻易能再现出与其战斗的情境，从而磨练自己的战斗技术。","raw_text":"从史莱姆到落武者，甚至是那些至冬国来的异人战士。只要精通心流的心得，就轻易能再现出与其战斗的情境，从而磨练自己的战斗技术。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":726500113,"next_line_ids":[726500114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":3037285058,"text":"顺带一提，世界上最强的生物恐怕是「雷晶蝶」了。岩藏流前代的永胤曾经借由老身的「心流」，尝试挑战有人类体型的雷晶蝶，但就连十秒也没能撑下去。","raw_text":"顺带一提，世界上最强的生物恐怕是「雷晶蝶」了。岩藏流前代的永胤曾经借由老身的「心流」，尝试挑战有人类体型的雷晶蝶，但就连十秒也没能撑下去。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":726500114,"next_line_ids":[726500115],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":1639501586,"text":"不仅仅是对手，就连风向、天候、机关、乃至「地脉异常」，老身都可以通过心流模拟。可以说得上是最实用的技术了。","raw_text":"不仅仅是对手，就连风向、天候、机关、乃至「地脉异常」，老身都可以通过心流模拟。可以说得上是最实用的技术了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":726500115,"next_line_ids":[726500116],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":613132802,"text":"既然心流这么厉害，为什么涉川先生要亲自挖角呢？","raw_text":"既然心流这么厉害，为什么涉川先生要亲自挖角呢？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":726500116,"next_line_ids":[726500128],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":2949348218,"text":"老身心流实在是太过…真实了，以至于弟子与假想敌战斗时，有时真的会受伤。","raw_text":"老身心流实在是太过…真实了，以至于弟子与假想敌战斗时，有时真的会受伤。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72650","main_id":72650,"main_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","main_description":"在稻妻，存在着相当独特的武道流派，其名曰「心流」。","chapter_title":"幻影心流幻想剑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265001,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265001,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":726500128,"next_line_ids":[726500117],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30054,"speaker_text_hash":3186642237,"speaker":"涉川","speaker_raw":"涉川","text_hash":648034298,"text":"即使是心流幻想的「剑」，也会砍伤手脚。而心流幻想的「火铳」，甚至真的能射穿身体。","raw_text":"即使是心流幻想的「剑」，也会砍伤手脚。而心流幻想的「火铳」，甚至真的能射穿身体。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265001.json"}
